<body><div>
<p begin="50000000t" end="90000000t">Good morning.<br/>It's raining today.</p>
<p begin="150000000t" end="190000000t">Let's take an umbrella.</p>
<p begin="200000000t" end="240000000t">I walk to the station.</p>
<p begin="250000000t" end="290000000t">I get on the train.</p>
<p begin="300000000t" end="340000000t">I've arrived at the office.</p>
<p begin="350000000t" end="390000000t">Good work today.</p>
</div></body>
